# Large image working files — the raw macro-photo set + full-res masters stay out of
# the repo. Only the web derivatives below (resized JPEGs, deep-zoom tiles, dot data) are
# tracked & published. (Negation needs the parent dir itself un-ignored, so ignore its
# *contents*, not the dir.)
images/canvas1/*
